# A Russian CV and cover letter: резюме, опыт, знания
subtitle: "Резюме and сопроводительное письмо: the headings of a Russian CV, short lines without я, and the set phrases of a cover letter — as Masha applies for a new post."
tags: ["russian","russian cv","cover letter","резюме","russian writing"]
teaches: ["writing/cv","vocabulary/jobs"]
thumb: "band \"Write your CV in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"At a Russian wedding: the man standing by the window","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/191-russian-wedding-participles.cast"}

